						<p class="rt-intro">Keep C#/Java for UI and interfaces, but express the core business logic in <strong>CLARA</strong> — a deterministic, auditable rule language a model and a human read the same way. Claude Opus 4.8 authors CLARA from a requirement, the server compiles and runs it, and Claude Opus 5.0 reviews it. Less code to re-derive, fewer misunderstandings, fewer hallucinations.</p>

